    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Try It Out! \n\n### This workflow automates generating audio files from a text source document.\n* It watches a target folder to pick up new files.\n* When a new file is detected, it extracts the contents of the text file and sends it to OpenAI for Text-2-Speech Services.\n* These notes are then export alongside the original source file for the user.\n\n\n### Need Help?\nJoin the [Slack] discussion (https://join.slack.com/t/educationalvistas/signup)",
        "height": 314.075983327943,
        "width": 609.8337893457722
      },
